    "terrainName": "city-battle",
    "description": "What: On city-battle, four APCs ('Convoy 1'..'Convoy 4') stand OFF the road in a column facing north at (200, 500..455), 42+ m south of the east-west road at y 541.8 (lane 0 of city-battle's SUMO-imported net: its lines ARE the driving lane); 'Convoy 1' leads a road convoy (ConvoyOrder, Mode Route \u2014 our own route) to (500, 586.8), 45 m north of the same road; the other three follow it (Rank 1..3, Gap 15). \u26a0 The route avoids the y-954 road: a hedge in the asset crosses it (x 135, x 221). Judge: (1) the lead runs PlatformConvoy; (2) it joins the road and drives its lane; (3) it leaves the road and reaches the target off-road; (4) the column never splits \u2014 the tail's lag behind its place stays under 40 m all the way; (5) the tail drives the road too and ends near the target. Fail: a follower routes on its own, the column stretches apart, or the convoy leaves the lane. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh cv-offroad-join-leave"
  },
